  "description": "Seo-Yun loves beauty, the beautiful and handsome. And what she loves even more is the R-rated comic book about a beautiful man and woman lovingly exploring each other! But the man closest to her, who truly embodies this aesthetic pursuit of beauty, is her direct supervisor... She'd imagined a relationship with him, but never thought it would actually happen. And it would be a \"contractual relationship\"!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
